[{"title":"送徐汝思 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"天涯明日故人疏，莫向樽前叹谪居。\n最是孤臣偏雨露，君王不问箧中书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24768,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐汝思 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"渔阳几载傍胡尘，此日骊歌济水滨。\n白首谈兵君自见，何须更问请缨人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24769,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐汝思 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"青樽华发对销魂，匹马孤城日色昏。\n爱客更为长铗引，一时回首孟尝门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24770,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐汝思 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"主恩千骑入防秋，幕府遥临上谷愁。\n今日故园迁客泪，谁知不是为封侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24771,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和许史秋日玉函观 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"瑶台十二玉阑干，月出名花映掌寒。\n自是仙人君不信，只今谁得醉中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24772,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和许史秋日玉函观 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"青鸟翩翩锦字通，玉箫秋冷玉函宫。\n情知洞里如花女，共指风流许侍中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24773,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日许郭殷见枉鲍山山庄","author":"李攀龙","text":"玉壶春酒石榴殷，此日中林见往还。\n堪是樽前几知己，那能不爱叔牙山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24774,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与三君登楼","author":"李攀龙","text":"谁怜王粲懒登楼，病起漳南对客秋。\n自喜赋成多丽句，因知座上有曹刘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24775,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和许右史初度村兴之作","author":"李攀龙","text":"一瓢春酒望青天，谁识箕山武仲贤。\n我亦颍阳饮牛客，犹堪击壤共尧年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24776,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日示殿卿","author":"李攀龙","text":"林头浊酒浸黄花，门外萧萧五柳斜。\n此日登楼人尽醉，谁知秋色在陶家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24777,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袭生绯桃栽","author":"李攀龙","text":"白云湖上酒家春，那更桃花照眼新。\n今日为栽三径里，怜君也是武陵人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24778,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送子与 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"北风吹雪雪漫漫，雪里题诗泪不乾。\n岂意故人摇落后，逢君五马入长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24779,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送子与 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"十年高卧白云寒，懒借新知锦字看。\n不是眼中人渐少，那能相忆使君滩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24780,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送子与 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"襜帷何处傍风尘，握手江湖白发新。\n此去更沽燕市酒，不知谁作和歌人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24781,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送子与 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"中原北望九河分，太守扬帆入五云。\n莫按腰间鹿卢剑，明珠今日便投君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24782,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送子与 其五","author":"李攀龙","text":"玉帛徵贤谒建章，颍川轩盖有辉光。\n君恩傥许留京兆，不必重来下凤凰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24783,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"殿卿别业 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"负郭田荒劝客耕，邻家酒熟任逢迎。\n只今何异吴门卒，枉杀梁鸿变姓名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24784,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"殿卿别业 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"床头诗草日生尘，架上长裾懒着身。\n自讶闭门无一事，春来拟作纬萧人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24785,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观猎 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"胡鹰掣旋北风回，草尽平原使马开。\n臂上角弓如却月，当场意气射生来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24786,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观猎 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"十月霜清紫兔肥，浮云不竞铁骢飞。\n半酣驱逐诸年少，朌子城东看打围。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24787,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬许右史九日小山见赠 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"南山秋色照东篱，又是陶家载酒期。\n彭泽罢来无俗客，何妨不许白衣知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24788,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬许右史九日小山见赠 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"我爱淮王上客贤，小山那在鹊湖边。\n开尊共泛金花酒，散帙同吟桂树篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24789,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬许右史九日小山见赠 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"十载衔杯望白云，天涯此日叹离群。\n重来秋色生双鬓，更折茱萸插向君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24790,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬许右史九日小山见赠 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"湖上青山绕郭斜，翠微深处半人家。\n谁知不解登临苦，醉杀犹堪藉菊花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24791,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元美 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"楚客龙泉照雪霜，曾携上国献君王。\n奈何一闭丰城后，紫气空干斗北长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24792,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元美 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"凭将白雪写朱丝，总是人间此调悲。\n纵使沾裳君莫管，古来能得几钟期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24793,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元美 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"自握明珠掌上愁，夜来寒色动隋侯。\n可知按剑人相视，任是衔恩未可投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24794,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元美 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"枥下长风万里生，谁怜汗血老无成。\n若教一奉瑶池御，八骏如云不敢鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24795,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得徐使君所贻王敬美见赠答寄 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"山中伏枕白云天，江上新诗锦字传。\n转向故人三致意，君家兄弟有谁怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24796,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得徐使君所贻王敬美见赠答寄 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"博物张华不易逢，十年京洛少从容。\n当时未得丰城剑，已识云间陆士龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24797,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得徐使君所贻王敬美见赠答寄 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"十载论文画省开，君家二妙日趋陪。\n那因见和池塘句，始羡风流小谢才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24798,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得徐使君所贻王敬美见赠答寄 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"弱冠文章满帝城，偶因家难负平生。\n中原莫恨论交少，海内今无骠骑名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24799,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"汝海清秋四望开，白云长在景夷台。\n已知千载无枚叔，谁爱风流汉署才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24800,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"使君为政杂风骚，绕郡青山照彩毫。\n不是赋成相倡和，那须更署范功曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24801,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"天子分符汉省郎，风烟汝颍更相望。\n府中但得平舆吏，他郡从教下凤凰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24802,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"鸿陂东注汝阳城，太守乘春出劝耕。\n童子但须骑竹马，夹车休唱芋魁羹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24803,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其五","author":"李攀龙","text":"水如垂瓠抱城流，西望千山入楚秋。\n帝谓使君终长者，褰帷不必更闽州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24804,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其六","author":"李攀龙","text":"高斋卧理簿书闲，掾吏裁诗日往还。\n片月不离桐柏水，白云偏傍弋阳山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24805,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其七","author":"李攀龙","text":"高盖崚嶒驾楚云，骖驔五马五花文。\n汉庭此日推经术，可是寻常作使君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24806,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其八","author":"李攀龙","text":"千骑如云汝水滨，铜符黻冕一时新。\n身为汉主分忧吏，何必龚黄好让人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24807,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其九","author":"李攀龙","text":"三河名郡郁如林，治行看君结主深。\n但使便宜长得请，守臣无意赐黄金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24808,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝宁徐使君 其十","author":"李攀龙","text":"解道文章老自知，中原病客重相思。\n故人寥落看如此，再领专城岂后时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24809,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"平台秋气郁苍苍，落日登临一断肠。\n若道子虚今未就，当年谁遣客游梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24810,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"梁园高宴日纷纷，帝子风流雅好文。\n若使平台宾客在，已知词赋不如君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24811,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"高斋只尺小蒙城，三载逍遥傲吏情。\n不是春风常入梦，谁知蝴蝶等功名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24812,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"秋色萧条傍谪居，体中今日定何如。\n从他几载风尘吏，不作平津相府书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24813,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其五","author":"李攀龙","text":"长吏应怜道路傍，三年参佐有辉光。\n纵书下考关何事，不必诗名入荐章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24814,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其六","author":"李攀龙","text":"楚娃双侍玉为颜，劝酒能歌雉子斑。\n醉杀休论官不调，古来迁客几人还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24815,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其七","author":"李攀龙","text":"睢阳小吏困逢迎，醉后参差故态生。\n莫倚甘泉曾献赋，君今久已罢承明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24816,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其八","author":"李攀龙","text":"来自庐山五老峰，梁园宾客更相从。\n已知无意二千石，出处何如邴曼容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24817,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其九","author":"李攀龙","text":"短发风尘老更繁，青云何日见飞翻。\n由来逐客人回避，遮莫词垣与谏垣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24818,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴明卿 其十","author":"李攀龙","text":"梁苑无人秋气悲，吴门回首泪堪垂。\n知君不尽平生意，海内穷交更有谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24819,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"咸池一奏合宫成，帝自垂裳拱玉京。\n多少侍臣调六琯，须知共作凤凰鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24820,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"春风忽送汉臣还，再入承明供奉班。\n怪得文章成五色，朝朝染翰近龙颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24821,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"君王赐宴柏梁台，七字新诗汉体开。\n首倡自天酬不得，曲终还赖岁星才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24822,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"汉家词客满金门，谁解凌云感至尊。\n一出子虚名便起，长卿无日不承恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24823,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其五","author":"李攀龙","text":"诏遣词臣集汉都，明年羽猎大誇胡。\n共怜执戟人犹在，莫问长杨赋有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24824,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其六","author":"李攀龙","text":"十载风流侍从臣，归来依旧帝城春。\n金华殿里谈经客，半是同时献赋人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24825,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其七","author":"李攀龙","text":"帝宠词臣弄彩毫，蓬蒿宫阙五云高。\n自怜一日成三赋，不分傍人赐锦袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24826,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其八","author":"李攀龙","text":"紫禁清秋五夜闲，金茎玉树少人间。\n不知帝遣神仙吏，更直蓬莱第几山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24827,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其九","author":"李攀龙","text":"依旧春风满建章，重来搦管对君王。\n即看应制偏承宠，何处新诗不擅场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24828,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送殷正甫内翰之京 其十","author":"李攀龙","text":"东观风流著作郎，满朝谁不羡恩光。\n赋成清思如秋水，一片霜毫洒玉堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24829,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"促殿卿之官 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"春色平台散客愁，淮南桂树小山秋。\n身为一郡风尘吏，借问何如此薄游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24830,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"促殿卿之官 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"闻道相知满帝京，时来不得避功名。\n纵今再补王门客，恰好逍遥遣宦情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24831,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"促殿卿之官 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"白云湖上酒家春，坐爱青山误此身。\n诗句近来多远兴，那能不作宦游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24832,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"促殿卿之官 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"夙昔分符结主欢，今来相国岂微官。\n也知合有抽簪日，且向山阴雪夜看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24833,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬许使君读鄙诗见赠 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"江湖几载避风尘，病里诗成白发新。\n不是使君相唱和，一时同调更无人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24834,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬许使君读鄙诗见赠 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"莫道西施宠最深，馆娃宫女正如林。\n何人不解矜颜色，敢向君王更捧心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24835,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"胡姬十五堪当垆，美酒青丝白玉壶。\n君但携来成一醉，知他谁是霍家奴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24836,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"裘马翩翩出建章，青楼日日拥红妆。\n才开春酒荼蘼色，说甚金茎露未尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24837,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"许使君见过林亭 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"解衣沽酒岂辞贫，散发狂歌也自真。\n林下似君看亦得，谁言嵇阮便无人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24838,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"许使君见过林亭 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"浊酒自沽还自把，先生寄傲南窗下。\n门前五柳渐看长，使君时时来系马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24839,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢中丞枉驾见过兼惠营草堂赀 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"夹户春风五柳斜，绕篱秋色醉黄花。\n南山只在茅茨外，人道柴桑处士家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24840,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢中丞枉驾见过兼惠营草堂赀 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"车马纷纷满四邻，中丞不厌草堂贫。\n自从一为苍生起，高卧如君更几人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24841,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢中丞枉驾见过兼惠营草堂赀 其三","author":"李攀龙","text":"结屋临湖八九椽，白云秋色共萧然。\n若言长者无车辙，何得中丞乞俸钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24842,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢中丞枉驾见过兼惠营草堂赀 其四","author":"李攀龙","text":"床头一卷大玄经，湖上千山闭户青。\n傥忆故园能载酒，贫家不让子云亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24843,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘令之邯郸 其一","author":"李攀龙","text":"春满邯郸十万家，若为潘令斗繁华。\n请看如玉丛台女，岂让河阳县里花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24844,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘令之邯郸 其二","author":"李攀龙","text":"为政风流不下堂，漳河春色动宫墙。\n遥知茂宰鸣琴曲，弹作罗敷陌上桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":24845,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]